  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<template>\n  <div class=\"flex h-96 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-16\">\n    <NeonBorder animation-type=\"none\">\n      <input\n        type=\"text\"\n        class=\"bg-background size-full rounded-lg px-4 text-sm\"\n        placeholder=\"No animation\"\n      />\n    </NeonBorder>\n\n    <NeonBorder>\n      <input\n        type=\"text\"\n        class=\"bg-background size-full rounded-lg px-4 text-sm\"\n        placeholder=\"Half border animation\"\n      />\n    </NeonBorder>\n\n    <NeonBorder animation-type=\"full\">\n      <input\n        type=\"text\"\n        class=\"bg-background size-full rounded-lg px-4 text-sm\"\n        placeholder=\"Full border animation\"\n      />\n    </NeonBorder>\n  </div>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "输入框、卡片等需要霓虹描边强调视觉焦点时。",
    "需要可配置双色（color1/color2）与流转动画速度的发光边框。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要玻璃折射质感的容器，改用 liquid-glass。",
    "按钮自带流光效果，改用 shimmer-button。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "animationType 可选 none/half/full（默认 half），none 为静态边框。",
    "内容通过默认插槽传入，插槽元素常需自行铺满容器（示例中输入框用了 size-full）。",
    "duration 单位为秒（默认 6）。"
  ],
